# Draft translation added by the fork maintainer; review welcome.
#. Add-on description
#. Translators: Long description to be shown for this add-on on add-on information from add-ons manager
#: buildVars.py:26
msgid ""
"Adds fast, local neural text-to-speech voices to NVDA. Provides a "
"synthesizer driver for Piper voice models via the Sonata engine, together "
"with a voice manager for downloading and installing voices."
msgstr ""
"Ajoute à NVDA des voix de synthèse vocale neuronales rapides et locales. "
"Fournit un pilote de synthétiseur pour les modèles de voix Piper via le "
"moteur Sonata, ainsi qu'un gestionnaire de voix pour télécharger et "
"installer des voix."

# Draft translation added by the fork maintainer; review welcome.
